        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Leaping Catch"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Ran-to makes a mighty leap and attempts to Grab a foe while he soars. He makes a Leap, High Jump, or Long Jump. His maximum distance is 40 feet. He must succeed at an Athletics check to perform the leap as usual, but regardless of the type of leap, the DC is equal to the number of feet he moves in the air. Ran-to can attempt an Athletics check to Grapple at any point during the jump. Immediately after the attempt, he (and the creature, if the Grapple was successful) falls to the ground. Neither creature takes damage from this fall."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "9e3b8909-832e-4ecd-a725-a18eb9d239b6",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:16.106207"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Whirlwind Toss"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: Ran-to has a creature grabbed\n\nFrequency: 1/round\n\nRan-to spins the creature he's holding, smashing them against any creatures within his reach, and then throws the creature aside. Ran-to attempts an Athletics check against the grabbed creature's Fortitude DC.\n\n- **Critical Success:** Ran-to tosses his foe a great distance. The grapple ends. The grabbed creature is thrown into a space within 10 feet, takes 10d6 bludgeoning damage, and falls prone. All creatures adjacent to Ran-to take the same amount of bludgeoning damage (34 basic Reflex save).\n- **Success:** As critical success, except the grabbed creatures is thrown into a space within 5 feet, and creatures take 6d6 bludgeoning damage.\n- **Failure:** Ran-to tosses his foe aside. The grapple ends. The grabbed creature falls prone.\n- **Critical Failure:** Ran-to loses hold of his foe and the grapple ends."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "three_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
